r's macro: capi_value)"] [284 3 "// a function of the program's own C"] [308 4 "// an Array# or ArrayArray# argument (UnliftedFFITypes, T16650): its elements as C sees GHC's, a word each,"] [309 4 "// an object's identity (a pinned byte array its address; anything else an address of its own, made once)"] [351 1 "// convRes is a C result in its representation."] [374 1 "// CaseE is a case: its scrutinee evaluated under a case frame, then an alternative chosen."] [382 2 "// the alternatives indexed (HE4d): byTag by a constructor's tag once their constructors are loaded, byInt"] [383 2 "// by an integer literal's value; made at the case's first use with enough alternatives"] [387 2 "// k: the continuation compiled to Go (aot.go), when the case's closure was compiled ahead of time"] [391 1 "// index makes the case's tables (a case of four alternatives or more)."] [398 22 "// a constructor not loaded yet: again at the next use"] [468 1 "// cont chooses the alternative for the value in the return registers. A case of an algebraic type with a"] [469 1 "// default alone may see a function: a class of one method's dictionary is the method itself (a newtype)."] [501 4 "// a class of one method's dictionary is the method itself (a newtype): a default only"] [557 1 "// LetE allocates closures and constructors."] [570 14 "// staticCon"] [573 1 "// allocClosure is a closure of l with n free variables to fill: a function or a thunk, and its free slice."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[48 24] [58 48] [70 26] [299 37] [307 27] [321 30] [421 21] [446 31] [455 25] [508 20] [509 23] [536 22]]} (go/file "nodes.go" :imports [


